    <comment>Update to 1.47.0

- Upstream release 1.47.0
- Re-derive the License tag comment: 1216 crates vendored, 607 linked
- Drop pkgconfig(sqlite3): sqlx requests libsqlite3-sys with the
  bundled feature, so the system library was never linked
- Declare bundled(aws-lc), bundled(libzstd), bundled(oniguruma) and
  bundled(sqlite3): four C libraries compiled in from crate-bundled
  sources that cannot be unbundled without changing the feature
  selection upstream picked</comment>
