  <revision rev="4" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>cd4facbabd308c3d3401b930e92fe025</srcmd5>
    <version>1.49.0</version>
    <time>1788773412</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>Update goose to 1.49.0.

- CLI extensions load in the background, so the prompt is usable before every
  MCP server has finished starting; &quot;goose session&quot; gained --system.
- Custom providers can fetch their credential by running a command, so
  short-lived tokens refresh without a restart.
- New providers Opper and Databricks Unity Catalog discovery; Z.ai default
  model id fixed and GLM-5.3-flash added.
- Upstream hardening: per-turn model tool allowlists, restricted extension tool
  dispatch, provider secret suffixes no longer exposed. No CVE/GHSA ids were
  assigned in the 1.48.0..1.49.0 range.
- Re-vendored (1328 crates, 612 linked); the 13-identifier License tag is
  unchanged. bundled(aws-lc) corrected to 5.7.0 after aws-lc-sys 0.44.0 -&gt;
  0.45.0.
- goose-system-libdbus.patch rebased for the iroh bump.

Built locally on aarch64 against openSUSE:Factory:ARM: rpmlint 0 errors,
0 warnings, 0 badness.</comment>
